                    "text": "Gems (no jewel): Topaz = +10% Magic Find/+20% Gold Find; Ruby = +20 Life/+2 Life per Kill; Sapphire = +20 Mana/+2 Mana per Kill; Emerald = +5 Dexterity/+5 Vitality; Skull = +5 Energy/+5 Vitality; Amethyst = +5 Strength/+5 Vitality.\nTir Rune: Ruby/Sapphire/Topaz/Emerald + Tir = +15 Fire/Cold/Lightning/Poison Resistance; Diamond + Magic Jewel + Tir = +5 All Resistances.\nMagic Jewel skills: Topaz = +2 random Assassin skill; Ruby = Barbarian; Sapphire = Sorceress; Emerald = Druid; Skull = Necromancer; Amethyst = Amazon; Diamond = Paladin; Chaos Onyx = Warlock. Each recipe also gives +2 to the named class.\nMagic Jewel + Shael/Dol: Emerald + Shael = +10% Attack Speed; Sapphire + Dol = +10% Faster Cast Rate.\nInfusion Orb + Rare Jewel: Topaz = +25% Magic Find/+50% Gold Find; Ruby = +40 Life/+4 Life per Kill; Sapphire = +40 Mana/+4 Mana per Kill; Diamond + Um = +15 All Resistances.\nInfusion Orb + Magic Jewel + Fal: Emerald = +15 Dexterity/+15 Vitality; Amethyst = +15 Strength/+15 Vitality; Sapphire = +15 Energy/+15 Vitality.\nInfusion Orb + Unique Jewel: eight class-locked recipes, each granting +1 to that class's skills (Amazon, Assassin, Barbarian, Druid, Necromancer, Paladin, Sorceress, Warlock).\nConversion Orb + Unique Jewel: Zod = +1 All Skills; Brak = -5% Enemy Physical Resistance; Zeph = +5% All Elemental Damage; Myr = -5% Enemy Magic Resistance; Grit = -5% Enemy Elemental Resistance; Hev = +50% Enhanced Damage/-5% Enemy Physical Resistance.\n",
